---
source: crates/rustman-cli/src/tests.rs
expression: help
---
List, inspect, replay and clear past exchanges (redacted)

Usage: rustman history [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  list    List exchanges, newest first: id, time, method, URL, status and total ms
  show    Print one exchange in full (redacted)
  replay  Send an exchange's request again, with secrets read from the store now
  clear   Delete every exchange (and its spilled body)
  help    Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
      --workspace <DIR>
          Workspace directory (default: search from the current directory upwards; outside any workspace, the ad-hoc history)

      --color <WHEN>
          Color: auto (a terminal without NO_COLOR or TERM=dumb), always or never
          
          [default: auto]

  -v, --verbose...
          Log more on stderr: -v requests, -vv headers, -vvv everything (RUST_LOG, when set, replaces these levels)

  -h, --help
          Print help
